tyle=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">module</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> undaqTools </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">import</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(43,145,175)\">Daq</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(43,145,175)\">File</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;C:\\Anaconda3\\envs\\py27\\lib\\site-packages\\undaqtools-0.2.3-py2.7.egg\\undaqTools\\__init__.py&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> line </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(16,16,148)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">module</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(43,145,175)\">ImportError</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(43,145,175)\">No</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> module named </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;daq&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">  </span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">How can I fix this?</p></div></div>"
